  "title": "Data Center Industry Survey Shows Significant Growth, Investment at the Edge of the Network",
  "summary": "Significant, industry-wide investment in edge computing will change the profile of the data center ecosystem over the next five years, increasing the edge component of total compute by 29% over that time. The magnitude of the industry’s ongoing shift to the edge is among the notable findings from a new global survey of data center industry professionals from Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions.",
